# {{.Name}}

AVR firmware for `{{.Mcu}}` @ {{.FCpu}} Hz, generated by `scaffold`.

Requires `avr-gcc`, `avr-libc` and `avrdude`.

```sh
make                      # build/{{.Name}}.hex
make flash PORT=/dev/ttyACM0
# or with CMake:
cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=cmake/avr-gcc.cmake
cmake --build build
```
